✅ COMPLETED: Environment CSP Header feature

In the environment context, added a table: Environment CSP Header that is used to build a CSP header for previewing the template. The browser now respects this header.

## Implementation Details:
- Added CSP directives table in Environment Context tab
- User can add/edit/delete CSP directives (e.g., default-src, script-src, style-src)
- CSP meta tag automatically injected into preview HTML
- Browser enforces CSP policies when rendering templates

